# beatmania III The Final, the floppy disk taken out and put in while the machine runs (--floppy
# FILE; HIRAKU only: "Floppy" is the drive's slot, not a MAME input). Out before the power-on FDD
# check, in again before the credit: the disk-change line tells the game, which reads the disk
# (NEW FD). Out once more on the options screen; a second credit then finds no disk and goes
# straight on.
game bm3final

at 1500 press "Floppy" 2                   # out
at 3000 press "Floppy" 2                   # in
at 3600 press "Coin 1" 8
at 3630 press "Coin 1" 8
at 3700 press "1 Player Start" 12          # the options screen: FD LOADING
at 4010 snap                               # NEW FD
at 4100 press "Floppy" 2                   # out
at 4400 quit
